Package: golfops
Title: Golf Participation and Revenue Summaries
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Justin", "Locke", , "justinrlocke@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Summarizes municipal golf participation, daylight-estimated
    utilization, and revenue for City of Mesa Dobson Ranch. Operating
    charts use one documented daily sample. Revenue ratios are historical
    relationships, and tournament results are break-even baselines.
    Forecasts of observed rounds are not latent demand and not price
    elasticities. Labeled synthetic examples cover a tournament ticket
    series and one municipal tee sheet.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: 
    https://data.mesaaz.gov/Parks-Recreation-and-Community-Facilities/Dobson-Ranch-Golf-Rounds/24g5-hb8k
